# Render: node <vhs>/dist/cli.js assets/tapes/commit.tape (from the repo root)
Output assets/commit.gif
Set Width 1000
Set Height 380
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 16
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms

Hide
Type `export PS1="> " PATH="$PWD/assets/tapes/bin:$PATH" && gum --version >/dev/null && clear`
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Show

Type "bash examples/commit.sh"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Down
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 1.2s
Type "tui"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 1.2s
Type "add README pictures"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 1.2s
Type "Recorded with vhs."
Ctrl+j
Type "No mockups."
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1.2s
Left
Sleep 400ms
Right
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
